"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 832896926,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "1. Declarar `proceso rectangulo(E ancho:numero; E largo:numero)`.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "1. Declarar `proceso rectangulo(E ancho:numero; E largo:numero)`.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_a21943242474",
"type": "text",
"x": 3274,
"y": 732.5,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1059843535,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1450239778,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "2. Repetir 2 veces: avanzar `largo` cuadras, girar a la derecha, avanzar `ancho`\ncuadras, girar a la derecha.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "2. Repetir 2 veces: avanzar `largo` cuadras, girar a la derecha, avanzar `ancho`\ncuadras, girar a la derecha.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
