"text": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"fontSize": 14,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 11,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_f5c47e3cbcea",
"type": "text",
"x": 4324,
"y": 901.0,
"width": 808,
"height": 18.75,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 769916434,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1140432051,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "1. Inicializar `anchx := 5`, `largx := 1`, `numer := -2`.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "1. Inicializar `anchx := 5`, `largx := 1`, `numer := -2`.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_1706078d219d",
"type": "text",
"x": 4324,
"y": 923.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1030295068,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1025056057,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "2. Repetir 3 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)`, reposicionar con\n`Pos(PosAv+1,PosCa+2)`, y actualizar `anchx := anchx + numer`.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "2. Repetir 3 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)`, reposicionar con\n`Pos(PosAv+1,PosCa+2)`, y actualizar `anchx := anchx + numer`.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_167b4ab714ac",
