"text": "4. Declarar `proceso izquierda` (dos `derecha`) para restaurar la orientación.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "4. Declarar `proceso izquierda` (dos `derecha`) para restaurar la orientación.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_a834e820100d",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 915.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 56.25,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 165107523,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 406364536,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "5. Desde el programa principal, repetir 3 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)`,\ninvocar `izquierda`, decrementar `anchx` en 1 e incrementar `largx` en 1 (arrancando\nen 3 y 2 respectivamente).",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "5. Desde el programa principal, repetir 3 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)`,\ninvocar `izquierda`, decrementar `anchx` en 1 e incrementar `largx` en 1 (arrancando\nen 3 y 2 respectivamente).",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_8553eadc8175",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 976.0,
"width": 808,
"height": 18.75,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1914596952,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 773507429,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "6. Reutilizar los mismos procesos `rectangulo(E ancho; E largo)` e `izquierda`.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "6. Reutilizar los mismos procesos `rectangulo(E ancho; E largo)` e `izquierda`.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_cf30133e4841",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 998.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 2009000654,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 498378591,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "7. Reposicionar en (1,5); repetir 2 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)` e\n`izquierda`, con `anchx:=2` y `largx:=4` fijos.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "7. Reposicionar en (1,5); repetir 2 veces: invocar `rectangulo(anchx,largx)` e\n`izquierda`, con `anchx:=2` y `largx:=4` fijos.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_d99dc1ded87f",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 1040.25,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
