},
{
"id": "tex_b42c3c1010c8",
"type": "text",
"x": 8524,
"y": 749.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1667761119,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 2141487985,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "1. Declarar `proceso JuntarFlor(E calle:numero; E NumFlores:numero)` con una variable\nlocal `CantFlores` inicializada implícitamente en 0.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "1. Declarar `proceso JuntarFlor(E calle:numero; E NumFlores:numero)` con una variable\nlocal `CantFlores` inicializada implícitamente en 0.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_afe34c64493d",
"type": "text",
"x": 8524,
"y": 791.25,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1744292311,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1245311104,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "2. Reposicionar con `Pos(PosAv,calle)` y girar a la derecha para orientarse a lo largo\nde la calle.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "2. Reposicionar con `Pos(PosAv,calle)` y girar a la derecha para orientarse a lo largo\nde la calle.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_2a9cffa9d173",
"type": "text",
"x": 8524,
"y": 832.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
